<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 0.69 points off FTSE, July 28.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 0.69 points off FTSE, July 28.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE 100 stock will go ex-dividend on Monday and analysts estimate the effect will be to take 0.69 points off the index on July 28.</p>
<p>						  DIVIDEND   INDEX</p>
<p>						  (PENCE)    EFFECT</p>
<p>		 COMPANY			  Net	 Net</p>
<p> * SmithKline Beecham	     4.41	0.692</p>
<p>The dividend amount includes a Foreign Income Dividend (FID) payment of 2.45p.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
